@TeamNexus.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5000

### Health check
GET {{TeamNexus.Api_HostAddress}}/api/health
Accept: application/json

### OpenAPI document (JSON)
GET {{TeamNexus.Api_HostAddress}}/openapi/v1.json
Accept: application/json

### Scalar UI (browser)
GET {{TeamNexus.Api_HostAddress}}/scalar
Accept: text/html

